  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 402.09 Effect of Signature. The effect of the renewal applicant's signature written in accordance with Nat 402.08(c) shall be:\n\n(a) The renewal applicant's certification that the information on the signed form is true and accurate; and\n\n(b) The renewal applicant's acknowledgement that the information on the signed form is available to the board.\n\nSource. #8679, eff 7-11-06, EXPIRED: 7-11-14\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nat100-700.html"
